OL,3,GNEWSATeens lured boy to park before
OL,4,Astabbing him, court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo teenagers accused of murdering a
OL,7,F15-year-old boy "lured" him to a
OL,8,Fsecluded spot and attacked him with
OL,9,F"severe force" in a row over money, a
OL,10,Fcourt has heard.
OL,12,FLuis Guembes died of his injuries in
OL,13,FGuildford's Stoke Park in January,
OL,14,Fhaving been stabbed in the head,
OL,15,Fshoulder and lower back - the latter
OL,16,Ffatally piercing his stomach, severing
OL,17,Fhis left kidney and hitting his spine.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
