OL,3,GNEWSATeens lured boy to park before
OL,4,Astabbing him, court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe prosecution told Guildford Crown
OL,7,FCourt on Tuesday that the defendants
OL,8,Fhad "agreed to rob" Guembes in order to
OL,9,Fsettle "a debt he owed concerning a
OL,10,Fbroken mobile phone".
OL,12,FThe defendants - 15 and 16 at the time,
OL,13,Fbut now both 16 - deny murder.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
